{
  "title": "Namaz For Seeking Allah's help in The Name of The Prophet (s) and Imam Ali (a)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "The following is also quoted from this respectable book: Imam al-Sadiq (a) is reported to have said: whoever of you intends to seek the aid of Almighty Allah (in the name of His Intimate Saints), may offer a two-unit prayer and then prostrate himself and say the following:\nيَا مُحَمَّدُ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ يَا عَلِىُّ يَا سَيِّدَىِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ بِكُمَا اَسْتَغِيْثُ اِلَى اللّٰهِ تَعَالٰى يَا مُحَمَّدُ يَا عَلِىُّ اَسْتَغِيْثُ بِكُمَا يَا غَوْثَاهُ بِاللّٰهِ وَبِمُحَمَّدٍ وَّعَلِيٍّ وَفَاطِمَةَ\nYAA MUHAMMADU YAA RASOOLALLAAH, YAA A'LIYYU YAA SAYYIDAYAL MU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAAT, BIKUMAA ASTAGHEESU ILALLAAHI TA'AALAA, YAA MUHAMMADU YAA A'LIYYU ASTAGHEESU BIKUMAA, YAA GHAWSAAH BILLAAHI WA BI-MUHAMMADIN WA A'LIYYIN WA FAATIMAH\nO Muhammad, O Messenger of Allah; O Ali, O master of the believing men and believing women — through you both do I seek aid from Allah, the Exalted. O Muhammad, O Ali, I seek your aid; O my succor, by Allah, and by Muhammad, Ali, and Fatimah.\nYou may then mention the names of the Holy Imams (a). Following this, you may add the following:\nبِكُمْ اَتَوَسَّلُ اِلَى اللهِ تَعَالٰى\nBIKUM ATAWASSALU ILALLAAHI TA'AALAA\nThrough you all do I seek nearness to Allah, the Exalted.\nOnce you do so, they will intercede for you before Almighty Allah, to grant you His aid at that very moment, if He wills."
}
